          },
          "worked": "Let $u=7x^3$ and $v=2x+5$. Then $u'=21x^2$ and $v'=2$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}y'&=\\frac{21x^2(2x+5)-7x^3(2)}{(2x+5)^2}\\\\y'&=\\frac{7x^2(4x+15)}{(2x+5)^2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
